-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5152d65\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>The Teacher&#8217;s Clarity<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ddd554 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7ddd554\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Her background as an educator, including working with diplomats and elite professionals, means she can explain complex health concepts with remarkable clarity, empowering you to become the primary agent of your own well-being.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Holistic Health Integrate Your Well-Being, Empower Your Life Holistic Health: Where Every Aspect of You Finds Balance. Where Western Medicine Meets Eastern Wisdom: Your Path to True, Whole-Person Health Our Pillars of Holistic Practice We work with you across several key dimensions to build a resilient foundation for health: Yoga Therapy &amp; Intelligent Movement Mindfulness &amp; Stress Mastery Energetic Rebalancing Lifestyle Integration Who Can Benefit from This Approach? Unexplained Aches &amp; Pains Persistent Stress &amp; Anxiety Fatigue &amp; Low Energy Digestive Issues Begin Your Holistic Transformation You don&#8217;t have to navigate the complex puzzle of your well-being alone. With a guide who understands the full picture, you can achieve a level of health you may have thought was out of reach. Redefine Your Well-Being The Synergy of Science and Spirituality Contact us What is Truly Holistic Health? What Makes Our Yoga Classes Special Holistic health moves beyond treating isolated symptoms to address the root cause of imbalance. It recognizes that chronic stress, a stagnant body, a restless mind, and poor nutrition are not separate issues, but facets of a single whole. Our approach integrates: Your Path to Wholeness: Integrating Body, Mind, and Spirit We blend the precision of medical science with the ancient wisdom of yoga to create a completely personalized roadmap to vibrant health, empowering you to live with greater energy, clarity, and purpose. The Physical Body: Through targeted yoga, movement, and an understanding of anatomy. The Mental &amp; Emotional Body: Through mindfulness, meditation, and breathwork. The Energetic Body: Through practices that balance your vital life force (prana). Beyond the Mat: A Doctor&#8217;s Approach to Holistic Healing Step into a new paradigm of health where your yoga practice is powerfully informed by medical insight. Guided by Shikha Arya&#8217;s unique expertise Address Root Causes, Not Just Symptoms: Target the underlying sources of pain, fatigue, and stress with precision Therapeutic Yoga Prescriptions: Receive yoga sequences scientifically designed for your specific health concerns. Build Resilient Health: Forge a strong, adaptable foundation that protects and nurtures your well-being for years to come. Program Time Table No comfort do written conduct at prevent manners on. Celebrated contrasted discretion him sympathize her collecting occasional. Do answered bachelor occasion in of offended no concerns. Monday Tuesday Wednesday Thursday Friday Saturday Sunday 06:00 &#8211; 07:00 Hatha Yoga Hellen 07:00 &#8211; 08:00 Ashtanga Yoga George 08:00 &#8211; 09:00 Kundalini Yoga Jasmin 10:00 &#8211; 11:00 Yin Yoga Mia 12:00 &#8211; 01:00 Vinyasa Yoga Joseph 02:00 &#8211; 03:00 Power Yoga Nick 04:00 &#8211; 05:00 Iyengar Yoga Maria 06:00 &#8211; 07:00 Iyengar Yoga Maria 02:00 &#8211; 03:00 Power Yoga Nick 04:00 &#8211; 05:00 Iyengar Yoga George 08:00 &#8211; 09:00 Kundalini Yoga Jasmin 07:00 &#8211; 08:00 Ashtanga Yoga George 12:00 &#8211; 01:00 Vinyasa Yoga Joseph 10:00 &#8211; 11:00 Yin Yoga Mia 12:00 &#8211; 01:00 Vinyasa Yoga Joseph 08:00 &#8211; 09:00 Kundalini Yoga Jasmin 10:00 &#8211; 11:00 Yin Yoga Mia 04:00 &#8211; 05:00 Iyengar Yoga George 07:00 &#8211; 08:00 Ashtanga Yoga George 02:00 &#8211; 03:00 Power Yoga Nick 06:00 &#8211; 07:00 Iyengar Yoga Maria 02:00 &#8211; 03:00 Power Yoga Nick 06:00 &#8211; 07:00 Iyengar Yoga Maria 12:00 &#8211; 01:00 Vinyasa Yoga Joseph 07:00 &#8211; 08:00 Ashtanga Yoga George 10:00 &#8211; 11:00 Yin Yoga Mia 04:00 &#8211; 05:00 Iyengar Yoga George 08:00 &#8211; 09:00 Kundalini Yoga Jasmin Holistic Health Through Yoga \u2014 South Delhi&#8217;s Whole-Body Approach Holistic health means looking at the whole person \u2014 not just the symptom, but the system. At Yoga Inner Power in South Delhi, Shikha Arya integrates her background in anatomy, physiology, and yogic science to address the root causes of common modern conditions: chronic back pain, stress, anxiety, poor sleep, hormonal imbalance, and fatigue. This is not generic wellness advice. It is a carefully designed, personalised practice. Yoga for Back Pain in South Delhi Back pain is the most common complaint Shikha encounters among South Delhi&#8217;s working professionals. Long hours at a desk, poor posture, weak core muscles, and chronic stress all contribute to a cycle of pain that painkillers cannot break. Yoga \u2014 specifically targeted sequences designed around your anatomy \u2014 can. Shikha&#8217;s students regularly report eliminating back pain they&#8217;d normalised for years, within weeks of starting a tailored practice Yoga for Stress and Anxiety Relief in South Delhi Chronic stress is not a mindset problem. It is a nervous system problem. The body has been so consistently activated by pressure, deadlines, and overstimulation that it no longer knows how to switch off. Yoga \u2014 particularly breathwork, Yin, and Kundalini practices \u2014 directly resets the nervous system&#8217;s baseline. Students in South Delhi consistently report improved sleep, lower anxiety, and a calm they can actually sustain within weeks of regular practice. Other Conditions We Support Through Yoga in South Delhi Yoga for weight management \u2014 sustainable, body-positive approaches that work Yoga for hormonal balance \u2014 especially valuable for women in their 30s and 40s Yoga for improved digestion and gut health Yoga for seniors \u2014 gentle, safe practices for strength and mobility in later life Yoga for corporate professionals \u2014 customised programmes for workplace wellness The Yoga Inner Power Difference: A Unique Fusion of Expertise What makes our holistic health approach truly unique is the guiding wisdom of Shikha Arya. She is not a single-discipline practitioner; she is a unique bridge between worlds. The Doctor&#8217;s Diagnosis With a post-graduation in medicine, Shikha brings a scientific, evidence-based understanding of human physiology. She can interpret your health from a clinical perspective, ensuring safety and precision. The Yogi&#8217;s Prescription \u00a0As an experienced yoga trainer, she translates this medical knowledge into the therapeutic language of yoga, crafting practices that target specific health goals, from pain management to stress resilience. The Teacher&#8217;s Clarity Her background as an educator, including working with diplomats and elite professionals, means she can explain complex health concepts with remarkable clarity, empowering you to become the primary agent of your own well-being.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_canvas","meta":{"_joinchat":[],"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-11","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/11","targetHin